{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-sng-3-1","title":"Song of Solomon 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The church's fight and victory in temptation. 6 The church glories in Christ.</p>\n<p>night. Ps 4:4; 6:6; 22:2; 63:6-8; 77:2-4; Isa 26:9 him whom. 1:7; 5:8; Joh 21:17; 1Pe 1:8 I sought him, but. 5:6; Job 23:8,9; Ps 130:1,2; Isa 55:6; Lu 13:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-3-2","title":"Song of Solomon 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>will rise. 5:5; Isa 64:7; Joh 1:6; Mt 26:40,41; Ro 13:11; 1Co 15:34; Eph 5:14 the streets. Pr 1:20,21; 8:2,3,34; Lu 14:21-23 I sought. Ps 22:1,2; 42:7-9; 43:2-5; 77:7-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-3-3","title":"Song of Solomon 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>watchmen. 5:7; Isa 21:6-8,11,12; 56:10; 62:6; Eze 3:17; 33:2-9; Heb 13:17 Saw. Joh 20:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-3-4","title":"Song of Solomon 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>but. 6:12; Pr 8:17; Isa 45:19; 55:6,7; Jer 29:13; La 3:25; Mt 7:7 I held. 7:5; Ge 32:26; Pr 4:13; Ho 12:3,4; Mt 28:9; Joh 20:16,17 Re 3:11,12 I had. Isa 49:14-18; 54:1-3; Ga 4:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-3-5","title":"Song of Solomon 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>2:7; 8:4; Mic 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-3-6","title":"Song of Solomon 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>this. 8:5; De 8:2; Isa 43:19; Jer 2:2; 31:2; Re 12:6,14 like.Probably the clouds of incense arising from the palanquin, which seemed likepillars of smoke.</p>\n<p>Ex 13:21,22; Joe 2:29-31; Ac 2:18-21; Col 3:1,2 perfumed. 1:3,13; 4:12-14; 5:5,13; 2Co 2:14-16; Php 4:18; Re 5:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-3-7","title":"Song of Solomon 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>his bed. 9; *marg: 1:16 threescore. 1Sa 8:16; 14:52; 28:2; 1Ki 9:22; 14:27; 2Ki 6:17; Heb 1:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-3-8","title":"Song of Solomon 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>all. Ps 45:3; 149:5-9; Isa 27:3; Eph 6:16-18 because. Ne 4:21,22; 1Th 5:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-3-9","title":"Song of Solomon 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>a chariot. or, a bed.{Appiryon,} rendered by Montanus, {sponsarum ithalamum,} \"a nuptial bed;\" but probably it denotes a kind of palanquin, perhaps synonymous with the Arabic {farfar,} a species of vehicle for women.</p>\n<p>7; 2Sa 23:5; Re 14:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-3-10","title":"Song of Solomon 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Ps 87:3; 1Ti 3:15,16; Re 3:12 the midst. Ro 5:8; Eph 3:18,19; Re 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-sng-3-11","title":"Song of Solomon 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"SNG","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Go. 7:11; Heb 13:13 O ye. 1:5; 2:7; Ps 9:14; 48:11 behold. Isa 9:6; Mt 12:42; Php 2:9-11; Heb 2:9; Re 1:7; 19:12 his mother. 8:5; Col 1:18; Re 5:9,10 in the day of his. Isa 62:5; Jer 2:2; Ho 2:19,20; Joh 3:29; Re 19:7; 22:9,10 in the day of the. Isa 53:11; Jer 32:41; Zep 3:17; Lu 15:6,7,23,24,32; Joh 15:11</p>"}]}